    "institutions_today": [],
    "paragraph": "A predictive geospatial engine utilizes a LightGBM model to forecast high-resolution, city-wide pedestrian counts in Loughborough, UK. An exact Branch-and-Price-and-Cut algorithm solves the bi-level optimization problem of placing electric vehicle charging stations while balancing planner revenue and user routing choices. Finally, a spatial assessment framework combines space syntax analysis and agent-based crowd simulation validated by physical pedestrian counts to evaluate narrative environments across historic districts in Xun County, China.",
